            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(abjuration, divine)\n\nA wyrmwraith's claws rend divine magic.\n\nWhenever a wyrmwraith hits a creature with a spectral claws Strike, the wyrmwraith can attempt a Religion check to counteract an ongoing divine spell effect on the creature."
